config BR2_PACKAGE_THOR_GPU_FIRMWARE
	bool "thor-gpu-firmware"
	help
	  The Adreno 740's firmware for the AYN Thor: its microcode
	  (qcom/a740_sqe.fw), its power controller's
	  (qcom/gmu_gen70200.bin) and the zap shader
	  (qcom/sm8550/a740_zap.mbn), from the linux-firmware release
	  ROCKNIX builds with. Buildroot's linux-firmware is older and
	  has none of the three: without them the GPU doesn't start.

	  https://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/firmware/linux-firmware.git
